SafeDesk arXiv source package

Top-level TeX file: main.tex
Recommended processor: LaTeX in PDF mode (PDFLaTeX)
Bibliography: references.bib; a matching main.bbl is included after local build
Figures: generated inline with TikZ/PGFPlots; no conversion or shell escape needed
Spacing: compact single-spaced article layout
Date: fixed in main.tex; no use of \today

Before public submission, replace the anonymous author and affiliation fields in
main.tex and verify the PDF generated by arXiv's processing system.
